.TH KHUSHU 1 "2026-10-16" "Khushu 1.3.5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
khushu \- an all-in-one Muslim app for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B khushu
[\fIOPTION\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B khushu
is your all-in-one Muslim app for Linux desktop, tablets, and smartphones.
It centralizes your daily worship by providing accurate prayer times, native
staggered Adkar notifications, and a dedicated Noble Quran reader with
ayah-by-ayah recitation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-background
Start the application in the background without showing the main window,
so notifications and the system tray stay active. Used by autostart
integration.
.TP
.BI \-\-display=displays
Launch on the given X display. Standard GTK option.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show the available command line options and exit.